<figure class="viz viz--flywheel" data-viz="prosperity-flywheel">
  <figcaption class="viz__cap">
    <span class="viz__family">Prosperity Flywheel vs Extraction Cycle</span>
    <span class="viz__q">How did structure change capability over time?</span>
  </figcaption>
  <div class="fly-grid">
    <div class="fly-card fly-card--up">
      <h3>Prosperity flywheel</h3>
      <p>
        Human Capability → Productivity → Arkansas Production → Local Ownership → Retained Capital →
